  <item>
    <title>Vol.014 如果你也想读懂一首诗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67673ac41e823e72d3aeb640</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67673ac41e823e72d3aeb640</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 22:44:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是「一些胡话」播客节目的第十四期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>汪洪申，北京邮电大学邮电部诗人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前一阵子，我偶然看到他发的一条朋友圈，以「祝我的文字阵地生日快乐」作为开头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是，又回想起一年之前，他创立了自己的公众号，名为「鹊室MagpieLand」，并时常写下一些让我难以读懂的词句。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZCBfwWzhzV6SkWw2vBV7Hf-TWT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>我隐约感觉到，那些文字是怀着崇高的敬意被写下，且浓缩着极为稠密的思索与汗水。这让那份难以读懂更让人感到遗憾，甚至不安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，我和他约了这期播客，一起聊了聊关于「诗」这件事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>的确，诗对于我们大多数人而言，是遥不可及的存在，也是早已被淡忘的事物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是，如果你也曾在深夜的备忘录里偷偷写下过什么，或是在读到某句精妙的耦合时，视线曾驻留片刻，我想，诗与生活的距离，其实也算不上太远。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论如何，就像标题所说，如果你也想读懂一首诗，欢迎听听这期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内容摘要</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 你写诗的起因是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 诗是什么？诗不是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 诗有一条所谓的及格线吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3903">1:05:03</a> 怎样写出一首诗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4693">1:18:13</a> AI 可以写出一首真正的诗吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5132">1:25:32</a> 诗对你而言是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> Duvet – bôa</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> Tek It – Cafuné</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">1:04:32</a> Dive - Olivia Dean</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4646">1:17:26</a> I Feel It Coming - The Weeknd / Daft Punk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5097">1:24:57</a> 怎么办 - 蒋山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5343">1:29:03</a> 回答 (Live) - 李志</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>聊天中提到的两首诗</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkF-Fdlxc-qVeYEiHdtYxIal378A.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqEHgF9_URfrh3QtfVYs6o8LH5B7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>: )</span></strong></p>]]></description>
