  <item>
    <title>Vol.010 剑桥里面有什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e327665ca6d0ace38a657f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e327665ca6d0ace38a657f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Sep 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是「一些胡话」播客节目的第十期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好久不见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前些日子，我在朋友圈看到了一位朋友前往英国的旅程分享，以及一些很美好的照片。他提到了一些在剑桥遇到的热情而可爱的人们，也拍到了一些我未曾见过的建筑与草木。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我对异国他乡的见闻与经历感到好奇，于是邀请他录制了这期播客，一起聊了聊关于他在英国、在剑桥所度过的时光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内容摘要</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> "我需要一段认认真真去玩的时间"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 英国真的只有炸鱼薯条吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 剑桥大学的传统习俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 如何通过煎饼果子发家致富？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="905">15:05</a> "人是可以无所事事的"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1142">19:02</a> "不往有中国人的地方去"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> Mr.Butcher 在奶茶店的一次偶遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">34:11</a> 论「腐朽没落的资本主义社会」之利弊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> "有时候需要一些运气，需要一些直觉，还需要一些行动力"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> "感觉像是一部电影的结尾"</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> Pizza Song – Cocomelon</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> Sway - Michael Bublé</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> All You Need Is Love - The Beatles</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a> London Calling - The Clash</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> Perfect - Ed Sheeran</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>: )</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvT7XYIL3updNm6L0Sd9Jw7lAVjf.m4a" length="52925867" type="audio/mp4"/>
