  <item>
    <title>Vol.008 一份秋日歌单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652b6d40a3b0404cbf176088</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652b6d40a3b0404cbf176088</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Oct 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是「一些胡话」播客节目的第八期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天到了。甚至，秋天也快要结束了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我喜欢秋天，阳光收敛，秋风温顺。在这样美好的短暂季节里，适合在熟悉的角落散步，适合在静谧的街道骑行，适合在一个无人陪伴的夜晚，听一些陌生的歌曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，我和几位朋友为你准备了一份秋日歌单。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你秋天愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>你将听到——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> Wake Me up When September Ends – Green Day</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 九月行歌 – 声音碎片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">09:37</a> 斜陽 - ヨルシカ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> After The Gold Rush – Nell Young</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 乱世情人 – 左小祖咒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> Your Love Is Forever – George Harrison</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 瞎子 – 尧十三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a> Concorde – Black Country, New Road</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2098">34:58</a> Last Night On Earth – Green Day</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> 遇见你的时候所有星星都落到我头上 – 高姗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a> Blue Banisters – Lana Del Rey</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> 夜深沉 – 群星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">51:22</a> 十二楼 – 莫文蔚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3377">56:17</a> ENDLESS RAIN – X JAPAN</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3768">1:02:48</a> 我的秋天 – 许巍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4028">1:07:08</a> Ob-La-Di, Ob-La-Da – The Beatles</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4216">1:10:16</a> Mark’s Theme - Black Country, NewRoad</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4349">1:12:29</a> The Glow, Pt. 2 – The Microphones</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4649">1:17:29</a> 平原 – 缺省</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4955">1:22:35</a> Alcohol – The Kinks</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5168">1:26:08</a> In a Sentimental Mood - DukeEllington / John Coltrane</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5420">1:30:20</a> 秋分 – 蛙池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5720">1:35:20</a> Fallen Angel - King Crimson</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6074">1:41:14</a> 怎么办 – 蒋山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6311">1:45:11</a> 再回首 – 赵已然</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>: )</span></strong></p>]]></description>
