    <title>Vol.004 一份夏日歌单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a1521a233bfbafdf77ca06</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a1521a233bfbafdf77ca06</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jul 2023 10:31:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是「一些胡话」播客节目的第四期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏天到了，这个夏天似乎格外燥热。阳光明媚、充足、灿烂，让人睁不开眼。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在睁不开眼的日子里，也许听歌才是正经事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，我们做了一个尝试——这一期节目并不是聊天实录，而是一期音乐分享。我和翔仔分别准备了十首夏日歌曲，分享给你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>供你消暑，也供你燥热。</span></p><span></span><p><span>废话不多说了，欢迎听歌。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>你将听到——</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 壁花小姐 - 柳翰雅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 下雨回家唱歌 - 七八点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 下雨 – 南京市民李先生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 大椰子 - 嘿！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 莫欺少年穷 – 九连真人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 我们的时代 – 新裤子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 萤火虫 – 上海彩虹合唱团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 君は天然色 - 大瀧詠一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1801">30:01</a> 初恋 – 王宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> The Summer Ends - American Football</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 寂寞的恋人啊 – 李宗盛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a> 洋鸟消夏录 - 万能青年旅店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 夏夜晚风 – 伍佰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> Hit the Rhyme - 蛋堡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> 亡命之徒 – 纵贯线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a> 快 - 七八点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3694">1:01:34</a> 伴侣2020 – 罗大佑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3918">1:05:18</a> 浮躁 – 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4092">1:08:12</a> 水手 – 郑智化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4375">1:12:55</a> I Wanna Be Adored - The Stone Roses</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>: )</span></strong></p>]]></description>
