  <item>
    <title>Vol.002 与二十岁不期而遇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645f67bc94d78eb3f7e26a06</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645f67bc94d78eb3f7e26a06</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2023 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是「一些胡话」播客节目的第二期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们请来了我的小学同学——冯骁和黑哥。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前几天是冯骁的 20 岁生日，借着这个机会，我们三个在一起聊了聊我们的二十岁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是如何变成了现在这个样子？我们的同龄人过着怎样的二十岁？我们的二十岁和父母的二十岁又有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对这些问题也感到好奇，欢迎收听这期播客。如果你也有些个什么想法，也欢迎在评论区和我们分享交流。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内容摘要</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 一个文艺青年为什么会选择理科？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 一场谈了五年的恋爱与"心心念念"的分手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> "我们是少部分人"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 大多数人的二十岁是什么样子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 知识真的可以改变命运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 父母们的二十岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 和曾经的自己相比，获得了什么？丢失了什么？又保留了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> "做自己"真的重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 我们都是这样失恋的——草蜢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 鸿鹄志——耳光乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 十块钱——岳云鹏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2479">41:19</a> 少年游——声音碎片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 十九岁的最后一天——伊能静</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkshk_pMsS3MC7XFeCCVpBPKQPTK.m4a" length="49292357" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1qNS_rxqaaSN_vnn2Ttxpcb2zs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.001 复读往事——我拿青春赌明天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6451386a7d934b8505729b66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6451386a7d934b8505729b66</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是「一些胡话」播客节目的第一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>云仔，曾经是我们的高中同学，现在是我们的一名学弟，就读于南开大学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中，我们和他一起聊了聊关于复读的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内容摘要</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 得知自己高考分数后的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 复读是因为没考好还是没学好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 高三是初高中最轻松的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 给小云仔的一些建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> "3+1"的培养体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> "我找到考试的感觉了"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 数学 145 没有竞争力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 能力越大，信心越小？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 复读是中国特色的 gap year</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 复读是复仇吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> "复读是我 18 年来真正自己做出的决定"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 复读带给你了些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> "你们的孩子长大了"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 因为你已经活成了励志本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 高考没涂答题卡？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3049">50:49</a> 九九八十一难，少一难都不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3307">55:07</a> "偷得浮生半日闲"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3694">1:01:34</a> 有桥的情况下，不需要摸着石头过河</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3779">1:02:59</a> 朋友们，再见！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 青春——沈庆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 潇洒走一回——叶蒨文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 秀水街——张玮玮/郭龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 灯塔——法兹乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 三百六十五里路——赵鹏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3784">1:03:04</a> 闹海——哪吒</span></p><span></span><p><span>另：考虑到这是我们的第一期播客，难免有不尽如人意的地方，欢迎各位批评指正。</span></p>]]></description>
